Rationale: The claim states that the movie starring Augustus Prew was directed by the founder of Klasky Csupo. While it is established that Augustus Prew starred in 'Copperhead' (directed by Ron Maxwell) and 'Dear David' (directed by John McPhail), the founders of Klasky Csupo are Arlene Klasky and Gábor Csupó. Neither Ron Maxwell nor John McPhail are identified as founders of Klasky Csupo. Therefore, the claim is contradicted.
